    "detailed_description": "<strong>Sex With Hitler:WW2</strong> is an action-packed top-down shooter set in the midst of World War 2. You take on the role of a Hitler fighting against the enemy powers, battling through the ruins of cities and the trenches of war-torn landscapes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298590/extras/95fcbdd428e580c629d0fd688e1e0650.poster.avif?t=1728939010\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298590/extras/95fcbdd428e580c629d0fd688e1e0650.webm?t=1728939010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298590/extras/95fcbdd428e580c629d0fd688e1e0650.mp4?t=1728939010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With a variety of weapons at your disposal, including rifles, machine guns, and grenades, you must take on enemy troops, tanks, and planes, as you strive to complete missions and achieve victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298590/extras/0521c4b73b8b1816c8e427d463a68819.poster.avif?t=1728939010\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298590/extras/0521c4b73b8b1816c8e427d463a68819.webm?t=1728939010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2298590/extras/0521c4b73b8b1816c8e427d463a68819.mp4?t=1728939010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you progress through the game, you can earn upgrades for your weapons and abilities, allowing you to take on tougher challenges and become a more effective soldier. This game provides endless hours of action-packed fun for gamers of all skill levels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense top-down shooter gameplay set in a WW2 setting.<br></li><li>Variety of weapons including rifles, machine guns, and grenades.<br></li><li>Realistic environments ranging from war-torn cities to battlefields.<br></li><li>Challenging missions against enemy troops, tanks, and planes.<br></li><li>Upgrades for weapons and abilities to improve your soldier.<br></li><li>Campaign mode for a story-driven single-player experience.<br></li><li>Realistic sound effects and music to enhance the immersive experience.<br></li><li>Historical accuracy in terms of weapons, equipment, and settings to provide an authentic WW2 experience</li></ul><br><strong>All characters are over 18 years old</strong>",
